"Insert SD card in BBBlue and power up using a suitable USB cable at the "
"micro USB bus."
msgstr "将 SD 卡插入 BBBlue，通过 micro USB 接口使用合适的 USB 线缆上电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-beagle-bone-blue.rst:72
#: 58e7e3084ada48a7ac2ee5b05f664fac 6331149c142d4b0fbc15bc254a280680
#: 6fbfe3f08f9d4dff8f44a04b20068010 788fa9d564644e59a80bf2f10a803da8
#: c3ca3e2d22324568bc48cccea44532b1 e5b2d12853ab48798b32ccd946261aa2
msgid ""
"Connect via SSH (``ssh debian@192.168.7.2`` on Windows and ``ssh "
"debian@192.168.6.2`` on Mac/Linux). The password should be ``temppwd``. It "
"is given at the command prompt."
msgstr ""
"通过 SSH 连接（Windows 使用 ``ssh debian@192.168.7.2``，Mac/Linux 使用 ``ssh "
"debian@192.168.6.2``）。密码应为 ``temppwd``，在命令提示符处提供。"

